    "updated_at": "2022-07-03T14:23:24Z",
    "body": "I don't know if you'll have similar issues but I had installed starship from a different package manager (homebrew on OSX), but then tried to switch to the cargo installation method. I guess the package manager didn't clean up other dependencies very well.\r\n\r\nI had some remnant bins in the package manager that were being used instead of the version of cargo I had installed. I cleaned them up and then I was able to use the correct version of rustc and cargo to build the project using the cargo install instructions.",
